{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2189310/extras/7576d0906465dc02320e687410b47bc3.avif?t=1761096350\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2189310/extras_big/7576d0906465dc02320e687410b47bc3.avif?t=1761096350 width=800 height=182 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Play as a turnip with a big juicy bum delivering mail to a cast of colourful characters on the sunny island of Arralla!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2189310/extras/31945e4b300184f3872bdc6be0888176.avif?t=1761096350\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2189310/extras_big/31945e4b300184f3872bdc6be0888176.avif?t=1761096350 width=800 height=130 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The best part of delivering mail? You can open every single letter and look through everyone\u2019s business! Whilst in the real world this is a crime, on Arralla Isle it\u2019s perfectly acceptable, and even encouraged!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2189310/extras/f7a282fda82066d13b4accfa8efaf0d7.avif?t=1761096350\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2189310/extras_big/f7a282fda82066d13b4accfa8efaf0d7.avif?t=1761096350 width=800 height=130 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the Arralla Isle Deliberry service, you'll have to solve where each letter goes through pictograms drawn on each envelope - and they're not always obvious! &gt;:)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2189310/extras/65282b356e26b26966e39731485c6678.avif?t=1761096350\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2189310/extras_big/65282b356e26b26966e39731485c6678.avif?t=1761096350 width=800 height=130 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn of the island residents\u2019 interpersonal problems through reading their mail - they will need your help to resolve them! Meet big booty cutie fruits like grouchy glassblowers, silly scientists, and deliver seriously creepy letters to an ominous house on a hill\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2189310/extras/b84dc0bbd4477cee29151e99e756a301.avif?t=1761096350\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2189310/extras_big/b84dc0bbd4477cee29151e99e756a301.avif?t=1761096350 width=800 height=130 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On Arralla Isle, there\u2019s no rush. The pace is slow, like a lazy summer day, so you can relax while you play. Exploration is a treat in this beautiful Australian landscape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2189310/extras/e66c25ed25aaf6de2551aa8ca778cf7f.avif?t=1761096350\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2189310/extras_big/e66c25ed25aaf6de2551aa8ca778cf7f.avif?t=1761096350 width=800 height=130 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Snap photos, kick over chessboard pieces, read about Arralla Isle\u2019s history, throw stuff, discover secrets. The island is your oyster. You can even call your mum!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There\u2019s plenty to do as a mail delivery turnip on Arralla Isle!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2189310/extras/293b7d9cab2c60c9010cfe9ed441d91c.avif?t=1761096350\" width=610 height=75 /></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"A Job Well Done","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2189310/3f7d07ff5f1f55cae5a11baf31cf6cef23f6bfbb.jpg"},{"name":"Apology Accepted","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2189310/6efab30e723e47f04066eb71815495da7a2731d6.jpg"},{"name":"Cave Explorer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2189310/c4f316ee8ab075578fa6b44fa5f9139f506172e9.jpg"},{"name":"Cosmic Companion","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2189310/da881f3dab6bfe99038663ac87fdf6f4932d41a4.jpg"},{"name":"Fan-hat-ic","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2189310/b8ffc3065454900a30356e512bdf5d404d7554bc.jpg"},{"name":"Gilded","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2189310/f9858072ce164878a9b41b989c3b683fea860ac5.jpg"},{"name":"How's Mum?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2189310/b09cfd0b79c38e9cbfc183cb4a856144e5800f1e.jpg"},{"name":"Interior Designer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2189310/06b3280eebcb50149a2ea8b54865340181e89a43.jpg"},{"name":"Mocktail Master","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2189310/2ab2aae8a50cf03257a25baf14ca36fa603505c4.jpg"},{"name":"Nobody Noticed That, Right?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2189310/94252cc04e967367dcaffdbc623dd21ff7cb07e2.jpg"}],"total":21},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2189310?t=1761096350","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2189310/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1761096350","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2189310/bf79cbc726020c6ccc95c0f2c018f0b0e00e758d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761096350","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2189310/bf79cbc726020c6ccc95c0f2c018f0b0e00e758d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761096350","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Adjustable Text Size","id":64},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3227080,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2189310/extras/7576d0906465dc02320e687410b47bc3.avif?t=1761096350\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2189310/extras_big/7576d0906465dc02320e687410b47bc3.avif?t=1761096350 width=800 height=182 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Play as a turnip with a big juicy bum delivering mail to a cast of colourful characters on the sunny island of Arralla!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2189310/extras/31945e4b300184f3872bdc6be0888176.avif?t=1761096350\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2189310/extras_big/31945e4b300184f3872bdc6be0888176.avif?t=1761096350 width=800 height=130 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The best part of delivering mail? You can open every single letter and look through everyone\u2019s business! Whilst in the real world this is a crime, on Arralla Isle it\u2019s perfectly acceptable, and even encouraged!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2189310/extras/f7a282fda82066d13b4accfa8efaf0d7.avif?t=1761096350\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2189310/extras_big/f7a282fda82066d13b4accfa8efaf0d7.avif?t=1761096350 width=800 height=130 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the Arralla Isle Deliberry service, you'll have to solve where each letter goes through pictograms drawn on each envelope - and they're not always obvious! &gt;:)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2189310/extras/65282b356e26b26966e39731485c6678.avif?t=1761096350\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2189310/extras_big/65282b356e26b26966e39731485c6678.avif?t=1761096350 width=800 height=130 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn of the island residents\u2019 interpersonal problems through reading their mail - they will need your help to resolve them! Meet big booty cutie fruits like grouchy glassblowers, silly scientists, and deliver seriously creepy letters to an ominous house on a hill\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2189310/extras/b84dc0bbd4477cee29151e99e756a301.avif?t=1761096350\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2189310/extras_big/b84dc0bbd4477cee29151e99e756a301.avif?t=1761096350 width=800 height=130 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On Arralla Isle, there\u2019s no rush. The pace is slow, like a lazy summer day, so you can relax while you play. Exploration is a treat in this beautiful Australian landscape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2189310/extras/e66c25ed25aaf6de2551aa8ca778cf7f.avif?t=1761096350\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2189310/extras_big/e66c25ed25aaf6de2551aa8ca778cf7f.avif?t=1761096350 width=800 height=130 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Snap photos, kick over chessboard pieces, read about Arralla Isle\u2019s history, throw stuff, discover secrets. The island is your oyster. You can even call your mum!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There\u2019s plenty to do as a mail delivery turnip on Arralla Isle!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2189310/extras/293b7d9cab2c60c9010cfe9ed441d91c.avif?t=1761096350\" width=610 height=75 /></span></p>","developers":["Little Pink Clouds"],"dlc":[4012800],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2189310/header.jpg?t=1761096350","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2189310/1755924676/b4ad4d1d394c8b39d2e7c2d0aea84c933d9675d3/1757986920/dash_av1.mpd?t=1757989188","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2189310/1755924676/b4ad4d1d394c8b39d2e7c2d0aea84c933d9675d3/1757986920/dash_h264.mpd?t=1757989188","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2189310/1755924676/b4ad4d1d394c8b39d2e7c2d0aea84c933d9675d3/1757986920/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1757989188","id":257198410,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257198410/movie480.mp4?t=1757989188","max":"https://video.akama