 colourful characters on an Australian island. Get the mail where it needs to go by reading residents\u2019 letters, solving puzzles, and exploring the island\u2019s sun-soaked beaches.","steam_appid":2189310,"support_info":{"email":"studiopinkclouds@gmail.com","url":"https://www.littlepinkclouds.com/"},"supported_languages":"English, French, German","type":"game","website":"https://www.littlepinkclouds.com/"}